## Unity-Specific Text Merging Configuration
# Force Unity text-based files to use LF line endings and treat them as text for clean merges
*.cs text eol=lf
*.cginc text eol=lf
*.shader text eol=lf
*.mat text
*.anim text
*.prefab text
*.unity text
*.asset text
*.meta text
*.controller text
*.overrideController text
*.physicMaterial text
*.physicsMaterial2D text
*.playable text
*.mask text
*.brush text
*.terrainlayer text
*.spriteatlas text
*.signal text

## Git LFS Tracking Rules (Large & Binary Assets)
